From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthony Fu <github@antfu.me>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:12:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): offer to set up the project on a host that lacks
 it

In New workspace, a host without the selected project looked like any
other host, and picking it silently lost the project. Its row in the host
picker now says "(project not exists)" and has a Setup button, which opens
Add project on that host at "Clone from other host", already searching
for the project, so it can be cloned there in a few steps.

Fork-Change: F-13
